+/// The model with multi-segment requests: half of the reads and writes carry 2 to SEG_MAX
+/// data segments, aligned and unaligned (address and length) mixed in one request, next to
+/// single-segment ones, at queue depth up to 64 (bounded by the 256 descriptors), on a backing
+/// with 4096-byte direct-I/O alignment and a 512-byte guest view, both engines, with random
+/// snapshots, restores and rate limiting. `MS_MODEL_*` like `DIO_MODEL_*`.
+#[test]
+fn ms_model_random() {
